	## Search Console 2026-10-08: verified migrated pages, not blanket homepage redirects.
	RewriteRule ^(?:index\.php/(?:en/)?)?berita/berita-terkini/kegiatan-penguatan-implementasi-nota-kesepahaman-dan-perjanjian-kerja-sama-mahkamah-agung-republik-indonesia-dengan-pt-pos-indonesia-persero/?$ https://pn-natuna.go.id/berita/kegiatan-penguatan-implementasi-nota-kesepahaman-dan-perjanjian-kerja-sama-mahkamah-agung-republik-indonesia-dengan-pt-pos-indonesia-persero [R=301,L,NE,NC]
